WEBVTT

00:00:00.660 --> 00:00:03.540
The people of Biscotti were enjoying
a brief moment of peace.

00:00:03.540 --> 00:00:07.230
Our Princess was looking 
forward to calmer days...

00:00:07.710 --> 00:00:09.940
...but there was a sudden 
declaration of war,

00:00:11.990 --> 00:00:13.550
of each country at stake.

00:00:14.260 --> 00:00:17.310
Now the battle begins for 
the Princess and the Hero,

00:01:58.700 --> 00:02:00.810
"Dear Becky, How are you?"

00:02:00.490 --> 00:02:05.370
The War Starts

00:02:01.370 --> 00:02:04.260
"Sorry I haven't been in touch.
I'm doing okay. "

00:02:05.210 --> 00:02:07.640
"I have a match today..."

00:02:08.080 --> 00:02:11.290
"I'll be sure to win."
And... send.

00:02:12.380 --> 00:02:13.620
That's right.

00:02:13.620 --> 00:02:15.990
There's a big battle between
 Biscotti and Galette today.

00:02:18.880 --> 00:02:21.220
Incoming mail

00:02:19.430 --> 00:02:24.080
Okay. Be careful and good luck!

00:02:36.240 --> 00:02:39.340
I was summoned as the 
Hero of Biscotti...

00:02:40.240 --> 00:02:43.080
...so for the princess 
who summoned me...

00:02:46.130 --> 00:02:47.470
...and for this country...

00:02:49.750 --> 00:02:52.810
...I will fight alongside everyone...

00:02:56.050 --> 00:02:58.440
...so that everyone who participates

00:02:58.810 --> 00:03:00.860
in this battle
will have a smile on his face...

00:03:04.430 --> 00:03:06.120
Everyone!

00:03:10.310 --> 00:03:13.340
Thank you all so much
for gathering here

00:03:13.340 --> 00:03:15.670
so early in the morning!

00:03:17.570 --> 00:03:20.660
Today is the day of the 
big battle with Galette!

00:03:20.660 --> 00:03:24.760
Did you all get a good night's sleep?

00:03:28.540 --> 00:03:31.560
Did you all eat a hearty breakfast?

00:03:34.120 --> 00:03:35.550
People from the general public who are

00:03:35.550 --> 00:03:37.610
participating in the battle,
please follow the directions of

00:03:37.610 --> 00:03:39.400
the knights and get 
into your formations!

00:03:42.180 --> 00:03:45.410
This battle will take place
near the border of our two countries.

00:03:48.640 --> 00:03:52.700
Our main camp will be 
here, Fortress Cereze.

00:03:53.150 --> 00:03:56.400
It will be mainly guarded 
by the garrison force of the

00:03:56.400 --> 00:03:58.880
Knights and the logistics support team.

00:04:00.490 --> 00:04:03.420
The main force will advance from the

00:04:03.420 --> 00:04:06.520
Chapal Lake Region
through the Valley Athletics...

00:04:06.520 --> 00:04:08.850
...and the second team, the vanguard,

00:04:08.850 --> 00:04:10.980
will swiftly pass through 
such grueling part...

00:04:10.980 --> 00:04:12.770
...to be the first to 
arrive at the main camp

00:04:12.770 --> 00:04:15.400
of the Galette Army at the 
Grana Floating Fortress.

00:04:15.790 --> 00:04:18.900
This battle will be expeditionary,

00:04:18.900 --> 00:04:21.460
so the troops will advance swiftly.

00:04:21.460 --> 00:04:25.360
Those of you who are not used 
to battle, cannot keep up,

00:04:25.360 --> 00:04:27.230
or do not feel well...

00:04:27.230 --> 00:04:29.620
...please be sure
to contact the

00:04:29.620 --> 00:04:31.490
accompanying medical team.

00:04:34.850 --> 00:04:39.000
Well then, form your lines!

00:04:39.000 --> 00:04:41.920
And move out!

00:04:45.200 --> 00:04:48.180
Princess, please take 
care of yourself...

00:04:48.720 --> 00:04:53.980
The elders, I leave everything to you...

00:04:54.490 --> 00:04:56.020
Chief, you take care too!

00:04:56.540 --> 00:04:58.250
Please don't worry...

00:04:58.840 --> 00:05:01.700
The search for a way 
to get our Hero home...

00:05:01.700 --> 00:05:04.980
please continue it during my absence.

00:05:04.980 --> 00:05:06.870
Of course, leave it to us.

00:05:07.260 --> 00:05:09.540
We will do our best as the 
proud royal researchers!

00:05:09.970 --> 00:05:11.290
Princess, Chief.

00:05:12.330 --> 00:05:14.830
It's time to go now. Please get ready.

00:05:14.830 --> 00:05:16.360
Yes!

00:05:16.460 --> 00:05:18.490
It's time, Rico!

00:05:18.490 --> 00:05:20.050
Yes, it is!

00:05:21.360 --> 00:05:24.380
Are you ready for that mission as well?

00:05:24.380 --> 00:05:26.930
Yes, everything is set!

00:05:28.580 --> 00:05:32.180
Hi! We are reporting
from in front of Filliano Castle in Biscotti!

00:05:32.450 --> 00:05:34.060
The troops have begun advancing

00:05:34.060 --> 00:05:38.100
for the big battle with Galette 
which is starting today!

00:05:38.100 --> 00:05:40.990
Look at all the troops!

00:05:40.990 --> 00:05:43.940
There are more than 20,000 participants
from the Biscotti side.

00:05:43.940 --> 00:05:46.460
That's a number we 
haven't seen in a while!

00:05:46.930 --> 00:05:49.540
Led by Rolan Martinozzi, 
Leader of the Knights,

00:05:52.430 --> 00:05:54.530
Framboise on the Galette side?

00:05:56.350 --> 00:05:59.250
I am reporting from in front of 
the Vanett Castle in Galette.

00:05:59.810 --> 00:06:03.410
The Galette Army has 
gathered 23,000 troops!

00:06:03.410 --> 00:06:04.510
Amazing!

00:06:05.070 --> 00:06:08.260
His Excellency Prince Gaul
and his troops are looking good as always!

00:06:08.780 --> 00:06:10.060
I see!

00:06:10.060 --> 00:06:12.240
I think the troops will probably arrive

00:06:12.240 --> 00:06:14.770
at the battleground in early afternoon!

00:06:15.000 --> 00:06:16.410
Gotcha!

00:06:16.410 --> 00:06:18.320
Sit tight and stay tuned
to Franboise

00:06:18.320 --> 00:06:19.710
of the Galette National Broadcast...

00:06:19.710 --> 00:06:22.100
...and Percy of the Biscotti 
National Broadcast

00:06:22.100 --> 00:06:24.270
for updates on the developments!

00:06:25.840 --> 00:06:29.100
Umm, Noir, Jaune, I hear 
that the protective powers

00:06:29.100 --> 00:06:33.020
at some parts of the battleground 
aren't that strong this time...

00:06:33.020 --> 00:06:34.680
We're supposed to investigate

00:06:34.680 --> 00:06:38.840
the area thoroughly and 
choose only the safe areas.

00:06:39.310 --> 00:06:43.130
But isn't it true that the 
Grana Fortress is haunted?

00:06:43.610 --> 00:06:47.620
Oh no, I really can't 
stand the idea of ghosts.

00:06:47.620 --> 00:06:50.030
Don't be silly!

00:06:50.540 --> 00:06:52.510
What's all this talk about ghosts!

00:06:52.830 --> 00:06:57.440
If you see a ghost, just cut 'em down!

00:06:57.440 --> 00:07:00.060
That's all you gotta do!

00:07:00.540 --> 00:07:02.640
General, you're so confident!

00:07:02.640 --> 00:07:05.400
But even if there aren't 
any ghosts or spirits...

00:07:05.710 --> 00:07:08.000
In areas where the protective 
powers are weak,

00:07:08.000 --> 00:07:10.280
there's a possibility that 
demons will appear...

00:07:10.510 --> 00:07:11.760
Demons...

00:07:13.140 --> 00:07:15.190
Neither man nor beast...

00:07:15.190 --> 00:07:18.120
...these demons feed on the 
flonya powers of the land

00:07:18.120 --> 00:07:20.670
and they take on a sinister form 
with the aura of the land...

00:07:20.940 --> 00:07:24.360
These monsters bring disaster 
and misfortune to people.

00:07:24.730 --> 00:07:26.320
No, I'm afraid of demons, too!

00:07:26.320 --> 00:07:28.800
Noir, no more scary stories!

00:07:30.220 --> 00:07:32.660
That's stupid!

00:07:33.010 --> 00:07:34.700
You know that they say that

00:07:34.700 --> 00:07:38.620
demons and monsters
have been sealed

00:07:38.620 --> 00:07:41.270
deep underground hundreds of years ago.

00:07:41.540 --> 00:07:44.100
All the theological and observational

00:07:44.100 --> 00:07:46.680
records say that is so...

00:07:47.240 --> 00:07:50.550
...but we still hear reports 
of sighting all over the land.

00:07:51.470 --> 00:07:54.270
But I also hear that
there are hunters that

00:07:54.270 --> 00:07:56.280
go around hunting those demons.

00:07:57.220 --> 00:08:00.580
They travel the land and hunt 
demons under the moonlight...

00:08:03.730 --> 00:08:05.790
Humph! That's silly talk!

00:08:06.270 --> 00:08:08.940
I don't believe a word of it.

00:08:08.940 --> 00:08:13.470
You've been reading too many storybooks!

00:08:14.370 --> 00:08:16.050
But I heard they exist...

00:08:16.620 --> 00:08:18.070
I'm not lying...

00:08:18.070 --> 00:08:21.180
General! Don't upset Noir!

00:08:21.180 --> 00:08:22.200
Huh?

00:08:22.200 --> 00:08:24.940
Once she get's like that,
it takes forever to get her back...

00:08:26.170 --> 00:08:28.150
What do I care! Idiots!

00:08:29.260 --> 00:08:30.440
I tried but I couldn't

00:08:31.090 --> 00:08:33.750
get my sister to tell me 
what was really going on...

00:08:34.590 --> 00:08:36.820
Sorry Princess, Sorry Sink.

00:08:40.890 --> 00:08:44.940
Princess Millefiore and their Hero...

00:08:44.940 --> 00:08:47.330
Yes... they're going to die...

00:08:49.730 --> 00:08:52.570
I found out six months ago

00:08:52.570 --> 00:08:55.260
that Millefi might be in danger...

00:08:55.700 --> 00:08:57.070
I see...

00:08:57.540 --> 00:09:00.760
Is that why you were so 
concerned about the Princess?

00:09:01.450 --> 00:09:04.140
It was about three months ago
that I started to clearly

00:09:04.140 --> 00:09:05.640
see that she was going to die...

00:09:06.630 --> 00:09:07.480
And at the same time...

00:09:07.920 --> 00:09:12.410
...the more I tried to warn Millefi 
and the people of Biscotti,

00:09:12.410 --> 00:09:14.990
the worse the stars became...

00:09:15.260 --> 00:09:17.810
And when their Hero arrived...

00:09:21.100 --> 00:09:24.040
The person who is to die 
is not Millefiore...

00:09:24.860 --> 00:09:27.750
It's whoever has Excelede and Palladion.

00:09:28.860 --> 00:09:31.230
I know that reading the stars

00:09:34.900 --> 00:09:36.860
...and to use it to change the course

00:09:39.950 --> 00:09:42.280
I know that, but...

00:09:43.620 --> 00:09:47.190
These past few months... 
it's been too clear.

00:09:54.050 --> 00:09:56.610
Of course you'd be worried...

00:09:56.610 --> 00:09:59.540
I wish you had at least told us this...

00:10:00.850 --> 00:10:01.970
I'm sorry...

00:10:02.680 --> 00:10:05.650
I still think that it 
is foolish to run a

00:10:05.650 --> 00:10:08.010
country based on the stars...

00:10:08.020 --> 00:10:10.450
...but if Millefi or 
their Hero were to die...

00:10:10.450 --> 00:10:12.500
it would bring so much worry
 and sadness to both countries...

00:10:13.650 --> 00:10:17.780
That's why I plan on stepping down
as the ruler of this country.

00:10:18.280 --> 00:10:19.390
But...

00:10:19.870 --> 00:10:22.330
I will borrow the Gran Vert...

00:10:25.910 --> 00:10:28.450
If I take the treasured 
swords from them,

00:10:28.450 --> 00:10:31.190
perhaps the star that symbolizes 
their death will move far away...

00:10:31.380 --> 00:10:33.810
You can't leave the throne empty.

00:10:33.810 --> 00:10:35.930
What will happen to 
the people of Galette?

00:10:36.510 --> 00:10:37.990
Don't worry.

00:10:38.550 --> 00:10:41.360
Galette was supposed 
to be ruled by Gaul...

00:10:41.960 --> 00:10:45.200
I just stepped in until 
the kid grows up...

00:10:47.810 --> 00:10:49.910
He still has a lot of growing up to do,

00:10:52.570 --> 00:10:53.980
Once he's given the responsibility

00:10:53.980 --> 00:10:56.290
and the support of
the people around him,

00:10:56.290 --> 00:10:59.430
he would make a decent ruler tomorrow...

00:10:59.820 --> 00:11:02.360
I know Prince Gaul's nature

00:11:02.360 --> 00:11:04.810
and personality well, but...

00:11:05.080 --> 00:11:08.810
You stepping down as ruler is 
another story all together.

00:11:12.480 --> 00:11:15.440
Leo-sama! You mustn't ignore us!

00:11:16.630 --> 00:11:18.900
When this happens her highness 
won't listen to a word we say!

00:11:19.760 --> 00:11:22.450
Leo-sama! Please don't be like that!

00:11:24.560 --> 00:11:29.100
Oh jeez... well how about this...

00:11:30.140 --> 00:11:32.810
We initiate a big battle and have both

00:11:32.810 --> 00:11:36.130
sides put up their treasured 
swords as a prize...

00:11:36.820 --> 00:11:38.620
The warriors are revved up

00:11:40.860 --> 00:11:44.510
It's a great time to request a battle.

00:11:45.620 --> 00:11:47.770
And as soon as we win the battle,

00:11:50.220 --> 00:11:51.850
someplace no one can get to...

00:11:52.460 --> 00:11:53.620
Of course this is just

00:11:53.620 --> 00:11:55.440
to prevent them from getting stolen...

00:11:56.550 --> 00:11:57.960
It has nothing to do with

00:11:59.480 --> 00:12:02.380
It's just for the two countries,
Galette and Biscotti

00:12:02.380 --> 00:12:04.260
that we make this proposal.

00:12:05.680 --> 00:12:07.490
What do you think, your highness?

00:12:15.480 --> 00:12:17.780
Our troops are making good headway...

00:12:17.780 --> 00:12:19.970
Our Princess Millefiore 
is quietly advancing,

00:12:22.720 --> 00:12:26.440
And her favorite celkul, 
Harlan is keeping pace, too!

00:12:28.580 --> 00:12:32.310
The Princess is waving!

00:12:32.310 --> 00:12:34.370
Thank you!

00:12:34.370 --> 00:12:36.750
Thank you, Princess!

00:12:38.090 --> 00:12:42.100
This type of assault goes 
against the code of conduct...

00:12:42.100 --> 00:12:44.760
I thought I should be the only one

00:12:47.180 --> 00:12:51.000
Don't be like that, let us help.

00:12:51.390 --> 00:12:53.350
We of the Imperial Guard

00:12:53.350 --> 00:12:57.060
will always be with you 
Violle, right everyone?

00:12:57.060 --> 00:12:57.990
Yes!

00:12:59.440 --> 00:13:00.890
Alright then.

00:13:00.890 --> 00:13:04.260
Our first mission of the 
day, infiltrate and loot!

00:13:04.530 --> 00:13:08.890
The Imperial Guard will infiltrate
the main camp of Biscotti...

00:13:09.620 --> 00:13:11.710
...and steal the Holy Sword Excelede

00:13:20.630 --> 00:13:22.670
It looks like the Hero and Eclair

00:13:22.670 --> 00:13:25.190
are in the same unit again...

00:13:25.190 --> 00:13:27.210
Yes... it was not voluntary, but...

00:13:27.210 --> 00:13:30.570
I must look after the stupid Hero...

00:13:30.570 --> 00:13:32.040
Hey!

00:13:32.260 --> 00:13:36.540
Dear Hero, you must get 
along with your partner!

00:13:36.770 --> 00:13:39.030
Don't tell me that!

00:13:39.030 --> 00:13:41.260
Eclair is the one who's always so mean!

00:13:41.260 --> 00:13:42.580
Shut up!

00:13:42.580 --> 00:13:44.550
It's because you keep 
doing stupid things!

00:13:45.030 --> 00:13:46.050
Stupid things?

00:13:46.410 --> 00:13:49.260
Hero, I hear that on the 
first day you met Eclair

00:13:49.260 --> 00:13:52.640
you grabbed her breasts 
and stripped her naked.

00:13:52.870 --> 00:13:54.640
Oh my! That's something!

00:13:54.870 --> 00:13:56.620
You've got things wrong!

00:13:57.400 --> 00:13:59.560
Yukki! Why do you know about that?

00:13:59.870 --> 00:14:02.360
Rico... She showed me a recording.

00:14:05.550 --> 00:14:09.110
Hero, you are quite bold, aren't you?

00:14:10.710 --> 00:14:12.990
That was just an unfortunate accident...

00:14:15.980 --> 00:14:17.910
Looks like the two who are

00:14:17.910 --> 00:14:20.000
going ahead are working together well.

00:14:20.000 --> 00:14:21.140
Yes.

00:14:21.140 --> 00:14:23.530
So the only concern is Demons...

00:14:24.280 --> 00:14:27.820
I'm sure there's no need to worry.
The weather is clear.

00:14:27.820 --> 00:14:31.010
And a protective wind blows 
over the land and heavens.

00:14:33.750 --> 00:14:36.520
Konoha isn't sensing 
anything strange either.

00:14:43.630 --> 00:14:47.670
Okay! Both sides have 
finished eating lunch...

00:14:47.670 --> 00:14:49.790
...and they are waiting for the signal

00:14:49.790 --> 00:14:52.440
to start the battle at 
the Chapal Lake Region.

00:14:52.970 --> 00:14:54.050
Listen carefully!

00:14:54.050 --> 00:14:56.230
As soon as they give the 
signal to start fighting,

00:14:56.230 --> 00:14:58.370
we will take the shortest 
route and pass on through.

00:14:58.370 --> 00:14:59.230
Okay!

00:14:59.230 --> 00:15:00.770
If it's right after 
the start of battle,

00:15:00.770 --> 00:15:03.720
everyone will be focused on taking 
control of bridges and securing fields...

00:15:03.720 --> 00:15:06.030
...so they won't notice us!

00:15:06.030 --> 00:15:06.710
Right!

00:15:07.030 --> 00:15:08.050
Artillery!

00:15:08.610 --> 00:15:10.800
You don't need to fire

00:15:14.580 --> 00:15:15.890
-Yes!
-Yes, ma'am!

00:15:16.000 --> 00:15:18.290
Everyone, thank you for waiting!

00:15:18.290 --> 00:15:20.310
The battle will start any moment now.

00:15:20.580 --> 00:15:23.640
I am Evita Sales from Biscotti 
National Broadcast and I will be

00:15:25.360 --> 00:15:27.000
on the Chapal Lake Region...

00:15:27.000 --> 00:15:31.070
...along with Jan Gazzoni from 
Galette National Broadcast.

00:15:31.430 --> 00:15:34.420
And now for the countdown!

00:15:34.420 --> 00:15:37.450
Everyone in the battlefield and 
everyone watching from home,

00:15:40.250 --> 00:15:41.750
Ready? Go!

00:15:42.020 --> 00:15:43.250
Five!

00:15:43.250 --> 00:15:44.750
Four!

00:15:44.750 --> 00:15:46.250
Three!

00:15:46.250 --> 00:15:47.000
Two!

00:15:47.760 --> 00:15:48.510
One!

00:15:50.420 --> 00:15:51.800
Start fighting!

00:15:52.070 --> 00:15:53.550
Advance troops!

00:15:53.830 --> 00:15:56.250
Galette Army, charge!

00:16:03.590 --> 00:16:05.060
We're charging through!

00:16:05.290 --> 00:16:07.210
Okay, Captain!

00:16:09.550 --> 00:16:11.210
Found our prey!

00:16:11.210 --> 00:16:14.110
Everyone! Surround 'em!

00:16:14.390 --> 00:16:16.870
Wait! This isn't going like you said!

00:16:16.870 --> 00:16:18.310
Huh? What?

00:16:18.310 --> 00:16:20.190
Shoot your arrows!

00:16:22.810 --> 00:16:23.780
Hero!

00:16:24.400 --> 00:16:25.440
Okay!

00:16:27.570 --> 00:16:28.900
Slash sky...

00:16:30.530 --> 00:16:32.260
Double cross!

00:16:40.080 --> 00:16:41.980
Die, Hero!

00:16:42.160 --> 00:16:44.100
What? Me?

00:16:45.420 --> 00:16:47.200
Yukikaze style archery!

00:16:58.930 --> 00:17:00.080
Hero!

00:17:00.480 --> 00:17:01.780
Yukki!

00:17:01.780 --> 00:17:03.540
Don't let your guard down!

00:17:04.100 --> 00:17:05.460
Sorry! Thanks!

00:17:06.690 --> 00:17:10.210
You won't get many points 
trying to stop us!

00:17:10.210 --> 00:17:12.560
If you don't want to be 
turned into cat balls,

00:17:14.110 --> 00:17:18.620
We can't do that now can we...
droopy-eared leader.

00:17:18.990 --> 00:17:20.780
We're here to defeat the Hero,

00:17:20.780 --> 00:17:24.100
not you, and to get the 
Divine Sword Palladion...

00:17:24.290 --> 00:17:26.120
Her Highness Leo has promised

00:17:26.120 --> 00:17:29.110
a big reward
if we get it to her.

00:17:29.340 --> 00:17:30.390
What?

00:17:30.390 --> 00:17:34.770
So you're the one who's in the way!

00:17:36.300 --> 00:17:38.500
How about a little 
something on the side?

00:17:41.310 --> 00:17:43.500
Get her, guys!

00:17:43.980 --> 00:17:46.990
It's true that back there I showed

00:17:46.990 --> 00:17:49.760
my skin because of that stupid hero...

00:17:53.110 --> 00:17:56.180
But I'm Eclair Martinozzi!

00:18:02.330 --> 00:18:04.220
I will never...

00:18:06.120 --> 00:18:08.150
...be embarrassed like that again!

00:18:18.850 --> 00:18:20.170
Eclair!

00:18:20.840 --> 00:18:22.280
You're all right, Hero!

00:18:22.560 --> 00:18:26.290
Oh no... I'm the, well 
Palladion is the target...

00:18:26.290 --> 00:18:29.040
Looks like it... but we 
can't change our plan now.

00:18:29.480 --> 00:18:32.540
But you should keep from using Palladion
as a weapon for the time being.

00:18:32.690 --> 00:18:35.050
Right. So I picked up a new weapon!

00:18:35.230 --> 00:18:37.430
Okay! We'll knock 'em down as we go by!

00:18:37.420 --> 00:18:38.220
Yeah!

00:18:38.220 --> 00:18:42.090
Well, it looks like both side 
are waging an intense fight!

00:18:42.660 --> 00:18:45.640
Countess Dalkian is back on the 
battlefield after almost two years,

00:18:47.420 --> 00:18:49.710
She is riding through 
on her celkul, Murakumo!

00:18:53.590 --> 00:18:55.810
Likewise, Leader Panettone is

00:18:55.810 --> 00:18:57.780
showing off her elegant moves!

00:18:58.130 --> 00:18:59.880
The medics have their hands full

00:18:59.880 --> 00:19:01.480
with the warriors
left in their wake!

00:19:01.480 --> 00:19:02.570
What a mess!

00:19:02.850 --> 00:19:05.380
But if a warrior is defeated early on,

00:19:08.100 --> 00:19:09.920
That's right.

00:19:09.920 --> 00:19:12.980
I hope they enjoy fighting

00:19:14.900 --> 00:19:17.260
Now let's check in with 
Percy at the frontlines!

00:19:19.280 --> 00:19:22.450
Well, the second unit 
for the Biscotti side,

00:19:22.450 --> 00:19:25.720
the Captain and the Hero
and Chief Ricotta's team

00:19:25.720 --> 00:19:27.220
have passed through the Lake Region!

00:19:27.660 --> 00:19:30.930
Fran here at the route 
to Cerese Fortress.

00:19:30.930 --> 00:19:33.310
Prince Gaul and his 
troops passed through

00:19:33.310 --> 00:19:34.900
here just a moment ago.

00:19:35.420 --> 00:19:39.150
It's unusual for the Prince to 
go far behind the enemy line.

00:19:39.470 --> 00:19:41.910
I wonder if this is 
some sort of strategy?

00:19:42.600 --> 00:19:44.910
Everyone, keep your guard up!

00:19:48.270 --> 00:19:50.240
Princess! I have a report!

00:19:50.850 --> 00:19:53.460
A messenger arrived from 
Galette just now...

00:19:53.460 --> 00:19:56.250
she says she has an urgent 
message for the Princess!

00:20:01.030 --> 00:20:03.120
I see. Send her in.

00:20:03.120 --> 00:20:03.920
Yes.

00:20:14.340 --> 00:20:15.610
Princess!

00:20:15.610 --> 00:20:18.360
Please forgive our 
disrespectful actions.

00:20:18.920 --> 00:20:22.360
But please listen to our request.

00:20:23.850 --> 00:20:26.220
Ummm, I'm sorry...

00:20:29.020 --> 00:20:31.790
I'm not the Princess.

00:20:35.820 --> 00:20:38.920
Alright, please don't move.

00:20:42.280 --> 00:20:43.430
It's too bad.

00:20:43.820 --> 00:20:45.450
I'm sorry for tricking you...

00:20:54.160 --> 00:20:56.890
Well, I'll bring you some tea,

00:21:07.560 --> 00:21:08.740
A signal from Rico!

00:21:09.430 --> 00:21:12.000
So they really attacked the main camp...

00:21:14.770 --> 00:21:18.080
Now I'm sure that Leo-sama is

00:21:18.080 --> 00:21:20.670
hiding something from me.

00:21:20.820 --> 00:21:24.680
She always won her 
battles fair and square.

00:21:28.910 --> 00:21:30.800
For her to be stooping so low...

00:21:34.150 --> 00:21:36.440
...there must be a good reason.

00:21:37.380 --> 00:21:41.150
So I must see Leo-sama.

00:21:42.050 --> 00:21:46.740
As the ruler of Biscotti 
and the owner of Excelede.

00:21:47.260 --> 00:21:48.490
And above all...

00:23:30.660 --> 00:23:32.250
Die!

00:23:33.260 --> 00:23:34.620
You're so popular, Hero.

00:23:35.330 --> 00:24:00.000
<b>Battle of Grana Fortress</b>

00:23:35.840 --> 00:23:38.230
Next time we're going to excel again!

00:23:38.230 --> 00:23:39.580
Grrr.
